    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AIRCAL\nSYSTEM TIMETABLE\nEffective November 1, 1981\nNOW SERVING\nPHOENIX",
      "PHOENIX\nThere's a grand new way to\nfly to the capital of the Grand\nCanyon State.\nIt's with style...AirCal style. And\nthat means non-stop service from\nOrange County, Ontario or San Jose.\nAnd that means savings, too.\nWhether you fly super-economy or\nregular coach, Aircal will save you\n40% compared to what you have\nbeen paying\nThat's AirCal style.\nAirCal style also is people...\nfriendly, helpful people trained to\nmake flying a pleasure for you."
    ],
